ng lot quality assurance sampling (LQAS) surveys to estimate whether OPV coverage\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Two indicators are used to assess the quality of AFP surveillance\"}]}, {\"v\": \"before/after or trend\", \"ev\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Nigeria has experienced a progressive decrease in WPV1 cases\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"A clustered LQAS methodology is used to assess SIA quality by sampling the target population of children at the LGA level\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"A sample is drawn from six wards (geopolitical subunits) within the LGA\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Two indicators are used to assess the quality of AFP surveillance\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}